;185;249mcompany\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtravel\u001b[39m suites, as\u001b[51Gt\u001b[53Ge stage plan's W09 section records. W09 doesn't repeat them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GCross-\u001b[12Geview\u001b[18Gwaits\u001b[24Guntil\u001b[30GW14\u001b[34Gcloses\u001b[41Gstage 4.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mManifest's\u001b[20GW10,\u001b[25Gstanding\u001b[34Gtrade\u001b[40Gpolicies\u001b[49Gand\u001b[53GNPC\u001b[57Gjobs.\u001b[63GBefore\u001b[70Git,\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gengine's\u001b[87Gfast-forward\u001b[100Gover\u001b[105Gquiet\u001b[111Gsteps\u001b[117Ghas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto be desig\u001b[15Ged, because it changes what every system\u001b[56Gtells the step. That's Opu\u001b[83G, high effort.\u001b[98GI'd\u001b[102Gstart\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Gfresh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsession\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15Git;\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Ghandoff\u001b[31Gis\u001b[34Gin\u001b[37GManifest's\u001b[77Gnothing\u001b[85Gin\u001b[88Gthis\u001b[93Gconversation\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109Gneeded\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
