9m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtravel\u001b[39m suites, as the stage plan's W09 s\u001b[74Gction\u001b[80Grecor\u001b[86Gs.\u001b[89GW09 doesn't repeat them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GCross-review wai\u001b[22Gs until W14\u001b[34Gcloses\u001b[41Gstage 4.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[22m Ma\u001b[12Gifest's W10, standing trade\u001b[40Gpolicies and NPC jobs. Before it, the engine's fast-forward ov\u001b[103Gr quiet steps\u001b[117Ghas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto be design\u001b[16Gd, because \u001b[28Gt\u001b[30Gchanges what ev\u001b[46Gry system\u001b[56Gtells\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gstep.\u001b[72GThat's\u001b[79GOpus,\u001b[85Ghigh\u001b[90Geffort.\u001b[98GI'd\u001b[102Gstart\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Gfresh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsession\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15Git;\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Ghandoff\u001b[31Gis\u001b[34Gin\u001b[37GManifest's\u001b[48G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/session-handoff.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Gnothing\u001b[85Gin\u001b[88Gthis\u001b[93Gconversation\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109Gneeded\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbeyond it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 18m 18s · done 8:25 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
